+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- A subcommand context receives the entry of the parent's ``default_map``
+  matching its name instead of the whole parent map, so nested
+  ``default_map`` defaults apply to subcommands again.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
